# General Behavior

- Communicate in Russian unless explicitly asked otherwise.
- Use English for code comments, variable names, function names, class names, and other code identifiers.
- Documentation files can be written in Russian or English depending on surrounding context.
- Before making architectural or product-facing changes, refer to `docs/ROADMAP_VISION.md` and `docs/TECHNICAL_STACK.md`.
- Use Context7 MCP for library/API documentation, code generation, setup, or configuration steps without waiting for an explicit reminder.
